On Nov 23, 2010 9:31pm, John E Clifford <kali9putra@yahoo.com> wrote:
> Nice, since these buggers give me more trouble than just about anything  
> else.
> BUT There is little (no?) indication of the various semantic and pragmatic
> roles that these indicators play.

Very true. Like the other cheat sheets this is intended as a support for  
memorization and explanation, rather than contaning the explanation itself.
This means that they are useful when you're learning, you know about the  
emotionals and their use but, for example, can't remember how to express a  
speicific emotion or just need a quick way to remember what {.iinairu'e}  
means.

I hope they can also be helpful for people teaching lojban that could have  
something to pass to their students.

Actually the first one I made was more intended to be a quick summary about  
space/time with some more explanation. I might go back to that style when  
I'll feel I'll understand enough about lojban to be able to explain things.

remo

